# Firebase & FCM

## Region & init

- Cloud Functions: `australia-southeast1` — use `regionalFunctions` from `firebase.ts`
- App Check: debug provider in `__DEV__`; production uses Play Integrity / DeviceCheck
- Prefer one-time Firestore fetches over realtime listeners for mostly-static data

## FCM background handler (critical)

`messaging().setBackgroundMessageHandler()` must stay top-level and run **before** app init.

- Implemented in `services/FCMService.ts`
- Imported from `index.js` — **do not reorder** those imports
- Do not move the handler into React components or late init

## Sensitive / fragile files

Avoid casual edits: `firebase.ts`, `index.js`, `google-services.json`, notification channel constants.

Document Firebase document shape expectations in comments when querying collections.
